+ *
+ * <p><strong>Date and Time Patterns:</strong></p>
+ *
+ * <p>Date and time formats are specified by <em>date and time pattern</em> strings.
+ * Within date and time pattern strings, all unquoted ASCII letters [A-Za-z] are reserved
