+ *     <tr>
+ *         <td style="text-align: center">4</td>
+ *         <td>Pacific Daylight Time</td>
+ *         <td>The <i>long specific non-location format</i>.
+ *         Where that is unavailable, falls back to the <i>long localized GMT format</i> ("OOOO").</td>
