+ * The tests to be performed are controlled by the flags
+ *   USPOOF_SINGLE_SCRIPT_CONFUSABLE 
+ *   USPOOF_MIXED_SCRIPT_CONFUSABLE  
+ *   USPOOF_WHOLE_SCRIPT_CONFUSABLE
